  "difficulty": "hit",
  "question": "求方程 $x \\mathrm{~d} y - y \\mathrm{~d} x = \\sqrt{x^2 + y^2} \\mathrm{~d} x$ 的通解.",
  "answer": "通解 $-y + \\sqrt{x^2 + y^2} = C$ .",
  "ref_source": "textbook:puheping_math_contest_v2",
  "techniques": [
    "分离变量",
    "一阶线性"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "s1",
        "text": "分析 这是齐次方程，作变量代换 $u = \\frac{y}{x}$ ，方程化为变量可分离方程."
      },
      {
        "id": "s2",
        "text": "$\\frac{\\mathrm{dy}}{\\mathrm{dx}} = \\frac{y + \\sqrt{x^2 + y^2}}{x} = \\frac{y}{x}\\pm \\sqrt{1 + \\left(\\frac{y}{x}\\right)^2}$ （ $x > 0$ ，根式取正； $x <   0$ ，根式取负）."
      },
      {
        "id": "s3",
        "text": "当 $x > 0$ 时，令 $u = \\frac{y}{x}$ 。方程化为"
      },
      {
        "id": "s4",
        "text": "$$\nu + x u ^ {\\prime} = u + \\sqrt {1 + u ^ {2}} , \\text {即} \\frac {\\mathrm{d} u}{\\sqrt {1 + u ^ {2}}} = \\frac {\\mathrm{d} x}{x} .\n$$"
      },
      {
        "id": "s5",
        "text": "积分得通解"
      },
      {
        "id": "s6",
        "text": "$\\ln (u + \\sqrt{1 + u^2}) = \\ln |x| + \\ln |C|$ ，即 $\\frac{u + \\sqrt{1 + u^2}}{x} = C.$"
      },
      {
        "id": "s7",
        "text": "代回原变量为 $y + \\sqrt{x^2 + y^2} = Cx^2$ ."
      },
      {
        "id": "s8",
        "text": "当 $x < 0$ 时，类似可得通解 $-y + \\sqrt{x^2 + y^2} = C$ ."
      }
    ],
    "final_answer": "通解 $-y + \\sqrt{x^2 + y^2} = C$ .",
    "techniques_used": [
      "分离变量",
      "一阶线性"
    ]
  },
